# Local tooling only. _tools/ generates character art from the brand logo and
# is run by hand; it has no business being served from the domain — the 600 KB
# source image and the lockfile would otherwise sit there for anyone to fetch.
# Everything else in this repo IS the site.
_tools/

# The game itself stays off production while /toadrun/ shows the
# "under development" teaser (the page's dev gate never loads game.js
# in prod, and this keeps the engine from being fetchable by URL).
# The teaser still needs style.css and assets/, so only the engine goes.
# Delete these two lines when the game launches.
toadrun/game.js
toadrun/lib/
